WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:37.840
Episode 17

01:37.860 --> 01:39.160
What did you witness

01:39.180 --> 01:40.640
on the boat on that day?

01:41.410 --> 01:42.880
I didn't see anything.

01:42.900 --> 01:44.050
You're lying.

01:45.410 --> 01:46.160
You know that guy!

01:46.180 --> 01:46.960
No!

01:46.980 --> 01:47.560
No?

01:47.580 --> 01:49.280
That means you did see someone.

01:53.180 --> 01:54.370
Stop asking!

01:56.410 --> 01:58.750
You're daughter of the Chief Guard of the capital city,

01:58.770 --> 01:59.670
but you still dare not

01:59.690 --> 02:00.670
say who it is.

02:00.690 --> 02:02.160
It must be someone

02:02.180 --> 02:03.850
with enormous power.

02:05.090 --> 02:09.090
Fan Xian, stop investigating.

02:09.490 --> 02:10.890
Who is he?

02:17.570 --> 02:19.170
You're new to the capital city

02:19.780 --> 02:21.370
and you don't know well of the situation.

02:22.370 --> 02:23.970
If you don't stop,

02:24.090 --> 02:27.330
your followers, and your family

02:28.420 --> 02:30.170
will be in danger.

02:35.420 --> 02:37.090
It's not that I'm not willing to tell you the truth.

02:37.820 --> 02:38.820
Because I can't put

02:38.820 --> 02:40.200
the whole Ye family at risk.

02:42.650 --> 02:43.920
I understand.

02:57.140 --> 03:01.370
All the clues couldn't be followed up and there is no way out.

03:03.340 --> 03:05.040
This is the only way.

03:08.700 --> 03:11.000
There's only one way out.

03:24.090 --> 03:25.280
Your Excellency,

03:25.370 --> 03:27.350
you'd already promised me to

03:27.370 --> 03:29.600
move these vats away last time.

03:29.620 --> 03:30.760
You always don't come in through the front door.

03:30.780 --> 03:31.470
If I move them away,

03:31.490 --> 03:33.120
how can I know you come in.

03:34.420 --> 03:35.710
Why are you still carrying the case?

03:35.730 --> 03:36.920
Didn't you go home?

03:37.090 --> 03:38.280
I did.

03:38.540 --> 03:40.600
I think I may use it

03:40.620 --> 03:42.480
when I do something for you.

03:42.570 --> 03:44.370
So I take it with me.

03:45.180 --> 03:46.760
Put it down and sit.

03:58.650 --> 04:00.040
Have more.

04:06.650 --> 04:08.810
You prefer bank notes or silver cashes.

04:09.210 --> 04:12.000
Bank notes. They're easy to hide.

04:14.340 --> 04:15.810
The promised fifty taels of silver.

04:17.890 --> 04:19.070
Your Excellency,

04:19.090 --> 04:20.960
what about the ox, the land

04:20.980 --> 04:21.890
and ten pigs

04:21.890 --> 04:23.310
that you've promised to give me?

04:23.330 --> 04:24.850
I have asked people to prepare them for you.

04:25.460 --> 04:27.720
Your Excellency you're always trustworthy

04:27.740 --> 04:29.690
and treat me as your child.

04:30.300 --> 04:31.600
Wang Qinian,

04:31.650 --> 04:33.250
it's a pity you don't do cross talk!

04:33.770 --> 04:36.280
What is cross talk?

04:36.300 --> 04:37.570
Linguistic art.

04:38.980 --> 04:40.590
If it's what you wants me to do,

04:40.610 --> 04:42.160
I can learn.

04:42.700 --> 04:44.370
You don't need to learn it now.

04:44.700 --> 04:45.580
If you're leisure,

04:45.580 --> 04:47.200
have a chat with me.

04:47.890 --> 04:48.750
About what?

04:48.770 --> 04:49.840
Whatever.

04:49.860 --> 04:50.870
Let it be.

04:50.890 --> 04:53.760
Fine. You start it first, please.

04:55.050 --> 04:56.250
How long have you been married?

04:56.930 --> 04:58.640
Seven or eight years.

04:58.740 --> 04:59.870
How old is your daughter?

04:59.890 --> 05:01.030
Under the age of five.

05:01.050 --> 05:02.190
When can I see her?

05:02.210 --> 05:03.280
My little daughter is naughty.

05:03.300 --> 05:06.370
She will scratch anyone she sees.

05:06.370 --> 05:08.310
It's good to be lively as a child.

05:08.330 --> 05:09.810
You're right, Your Excellency.

05:10.330 --> 05:12.410
Where is Si Lili imprisoned?

05:14.260 --> 05:16.400
The dungeon in the Investigator's Office.

05:16.420 --> 05:17.520
Heavily fortified?

05:17.540 --> 05:18.920
Heavily fortified.

05:19.740 --> 05:21.250
You are good at drawing, right?

05:23.770 --> 05:24.910
Yes.

05:24.930 --> 05:27.250
About the entrance and exit to
the dungeon in the Investigator's Office

05:27.490 --> 05:28.850
and the guard there,

05:29.300 --> 05:30.720
draw a copy for me.

05:39.170 --> 05:40.470
Your Excellency, these stuffs are…

05:40.490 --> 05:41.630
Leave them alone.

05:41.650 --> 05:43.440
Draw a copy of the entrance and exit

05:43.460 --> 05:45.130
to the dungeon

05:45.370 --> 05:46.920
and the guard conditions.

05:48.980 --> 05:50.250
Your Excellency,

05:50.700 --> 05:53.470
no one can survive from

05:53.490 --> 05:55.470
invading into the dungeon of
the Investigator's Office down the ages.

05:55.490 --> 05:56.640
Just draw it for me.

06:11.210 --> 06:13.690
Brother, are you in there?

06:14.260 --> 06:15.640
You mind your own business.

06:24.980 --> 06:26.150
Can I have a minute?

06:26.170 --> 06:27.290
What's up?

06:28.140 --> 06:30.470
I went to meet the Crown Prince today.

06:30.490 --> 06:31.350
I told him

06:31.370 --> 06:32.470
I'm willing to look into

06:32.490 --> 06:34.010
your words and deeds for him.

06:34.050 --> 06:35.640
He wasn't opposed to my idea.

06:43.770 --> 06:45.200
Why did you turn to him?

06:45.650 --> 06:46.970
I want to help you.

06:47.460 --> 06:49.000
In the assassination happened in the Niulan Street,

06:49.020 --> 06:50.150
you almost lost your life.

06:50.170 --> 06:52.030
Now you take the suspect of the assassination,

06:52.050 --> 06:53.030
Si Lili

06:53.050 --> 06:54.320
back to the capital city.

06:54.370 --> 06:55.800
The one who wants to kill you

06:55.820 --> 06:57.480
will take actions for sure.

06:57.540 --> 06:59.720
Are you suspecting that the Crown Prince wants to kill me?

06:59.980 --> 07:02.010
It's not long that you come to the capital city.

07:02.370 --> 07:03.020
You haven't made enemies with the Crown Prince,

07:03.020 --> 07:04.870
except that you beat Guo Baokun

07:04.890 --> 07:06.740
who is one of His Highness's followers.

07:06.740 --> 07:08.020
To kill me for Guo Baokun?

07:08.020 --> 07:09.440
Lack of motivation.

07:10.260 --> 07:13.120
Then he must aim at the financial power of the Neiku.

07:13.140 --> 07:15.440
It's just your baseless conjecture.
We are not sure about it.

07:16.140 --> 07:17.590
So I went to meet him

07:17.610 --> 07:19.310
to check whether

07:19.330 --> 07:20.980
he has the absolute intention to kill you.

07:20.980 --> 07:22.320
Can you confirm that?

07:22.930 --> 07:24.410
I can't.

07:25.020 --> 07:25.930
Rumor has it that

07:25.930 --> 07:28.000
the Crown Prince is not
as talented as the Second Prince and

07:28.020 --> 07:29.190
he is weak.

07:29.210 --> 07:31.200
As what I have seen today,

07:31.330 --> 07:33.120
he didn't show how he feels on his face

07:33.140 --> 07:34.630
and hid his thoughts deep.

07:34.650 --> 07:36.250
He couldn't be ordinary.

07:39.020 --> 07:40.760
It's too dangerous.

07:40.980 --> 07:42.410
Don't take risks anymore.

07:43.330 --> 07:46.150
Brother, when I went to him today,

07:46.170 --> 07:47.720
he was drawing.

07:48.050 --> 07:51.010
It seemed he was being trapped for love.

07:51.050 --> 07:52.240
How could you say that?

07:52.260 --> 07:54.000
Except what he drew today,

07:54.020 --> 07:55.190
there were many portraits of a lady

07:55.210 --> 07:57.000
without the five sense organs

07:57.020 --> 07:58.590
in his study.

07:58.610 --> 08:01.200
He buried his feelings so deep

08:01.420 --> 08:03.250
that he didn't want anyone to know

08:03.420 --> 08:05.130
who the lady is.

08:05.890 --> 08:07.440
Have you ever heard which lady

08:07.460 --> 08:08.920
the Crown Prince has feelings for?

08:09.050 --> 08:10.150
I never heard

08:10.170 --> 08:12.290
which lady he get close to.

08:14.650 --> 08:16.250
Whoever he likes,

08:17.540 --> 08:19.250
as the Crown Prince,

08:19.460 --> 08:21.720
he isn't supposed to puzzle over that.

08:22.930 --> 08:26.010
What if the lady is a courtesan?

08:26.300 --> 08:27.840
It doesn't matter.

08:27.860 --> 08:28.460
It's nothing but gaining

08:28.460 --> 08:29.840
a dissolute reputation.

08:29.860 --> 08:31.130
He doesn't have to hide.

08:31.740 --> 08:34.350
What if he knows the courtesan

08:34.370 --> 08:36.080
is a secret agent from Beiqi?

08:37.220 --> 08:38.690
Si Lili?

08:38.850 --> 08:40.120
Once someone finds that

08:40.140 --> 08:42.600
the Crown Prince colludes with Beiqi secretly,

08:42.660 --> 08:44.690
the host of the Eastern Palace will be replaced.

08:44.820 --> 08:45.850
The Crown Prince doesn't want to expose

08:45.850 --> 08:47.150
who Si Lili really is.

08:47.170 --> 08:49.080
And he can't get close to her either.

08:49.290 --> 08:51.150
What he can do is bury his feelings

08:51.170 --> 08:52.810
in his drawings.

08:53.850 --> 08:55.770
The story is too dramatic.

08:56.610 --> 08:58.010
Is it a story?

08:58.970 --> 08:59.830
What do you mean by that?

08:59.850 --> 09:01.890
Forget it. Keep saying.

09:03.530 --> 09:04.640
Later,

09:04.660 --> 09:06.320
he heard you slept with

09:06.340 --> 09:07.440
Si Lili for one night.

09:07.460 --> 09:10.280
Your affections drove him crazy.

09:10.370 --> 09:12.810
So he wants to kill you to give vent to his anger

09:13.260 --> 09:15.270
and forces Si Lili to get involved in the case.

09:15.290 --> 09:17.920
He makes you two enemies of life and death

09:18.050 --> 09:21.000
to relieve his deep depression.

09:21.020 --> 09:22.710
Just because of seeing the portraits of a lady,

09:22.730 --> 09:24.510
you make up a complete story at the moment?

09:24.530 --> 09:25.960
It might be the whole story.

09:26.490 --> 09:27.720
Your Excellency.

09:28.730 --> 09:30.040
Your Excellency.

09:30.170 --> 09:31.480
I'm here.

09:36.370 --> 09:37.600
Your Excellency.

09:38.700 --> 09:40.560
I have finished the copy

09:40.580 --> 09:42.000
and written down

09:42.020 --> 09:43.440
where the guards

09:43.460 --> 09:45.400
and invisible sentries may stay for you.

09:48.900 --> 09:50.240
Lady Ruoruo, you're here.

09:50.260 --> 09:52.720
What copy? What about invisible sentries?

09:56.140 --> 09:58.280
Brother, what are you going to do?

10:13.900 --> 10:15.690
You have known I'm going to take actions tonight?

10:21.580 --> 10:23.410
I knew it when you asked me

10:23.410 --> 10:24.810
to draw the copy this afternoon.

10:25.970 --> 10:27.210
Why are you waiting for me here?

10:32.050 --> 10:33.330
The rope of the hook

10:33.700 --> 10:36.890
is made of hairs and spider web.

10:37.050 --> 10:38.350
It can't be broken easily

10:38.370 --> 10:40.640
and is excellent for climbing over the wall.

10:40.660 --> 10:42.510
I can climb walls with my unique inner power.

10:42.530 --> 10:44.210
I don't have to use it.

10:45.730 --> 10:47.650
This is the dizzy incense

10:47.700 --> 10:49.800
that is best for using in a small room.

10:49.820 --> 10:50.880
I learned to poison from a child.

10:50.900 --> 10:53.210
I can make it myself.

10:55.780 --> 10:58.390
The shoe sole is made of cotton

10:58.410 --> 11:00.510
that is best for walking on

11:00.530 --> 11:01.370
roofs and tiles at night.

11:01.370 --> 11:02.710
You are here for selling goods?

11:02.730 --> 11:04.590
Not selling. I will give them to you.

11:04.610 --> 11:06.080
It's not like you.

11:08.530 --> 11:09.920
Your Excellency,

11:11.020 --> 11:13.600
invading into the dungeon,
you will be sentenced to death if you are caught.

11:13.780 --> 11:15.960
I have a family.

11:16.100 --> 11:18.440
Please forgive me for not going with you.

11:18.460 --> 11:19.390
It will be good

11:19.410 --> 11:21.920
if these things can help.

11:23.290 --> 11:24.510
Pack them up.

11:24.530 --> 11:25.470
No no no.

11:25.490 --> 11:26.960
I have other things.

11:27.410 --> 11:28.510
If I am arrested,

11:28.530 --> 11:29.410
they can find you out

11:29.410 --> 11:30.810
because of these things.

11:35.340 --> 11:36.690
That makes sense.

11:38.290 --> 11:39.030
Thanks.

11:39.050 --> 11:41.210
Don't let anyone know you have seen me.

12:08.850 --> 12:10.890
Now I probably know

12:11.780 --> 12:12.560
why you want to

12:12.580 --> 12:14.450
change the world.

12:15.900 --> 12:17.600
A life was taken away,

12:18.140 --> 12:20.040
but no one cares

12:21.340 --> 12:22.780
just because he was a guard,

12:22.780 --> 12:24.810
and he deserved the death.

13:37.460 --> 13:38.680
We meet again.

13:38.700 --> 13:39.760
Why are you here?

13:39.780 --> 13:41.440
It's urgent. No more nonsense.

13:41.460 --> 13:43.450
Tell me who on earth wants to kill me.

13:44.220 --> 13:45.120
Take me out of here.

13:45.140 --> 13:46.080
I will.

13:46.100 --> 13:47.120
Tell me who he is,

13:47.140 --> 13:48.400
I will save you.

13:49.820 --> 13:51.450
You don't trust me?

13:51.850 --> 13:54.960
Mr. Fan, why not turn your back to have a look first.

14:00.700 --> 14:03.450
Si Lili is the secret agent from Beiqi

14:03.660 --> 14:05.770
but colludes with the Capital Garrison.

14:06.020 --> 14:07.710
The commander of the Capital Garrison died.

14:07.730 --> 14:09.210
He was supposed to be killed.

14:09.290 --> 14:10.560
We can know the person who demanded to kill

14:10.580 --> 14:13.440
must be paramount and powerful.

14:13.460 --> 14:15.770
Now Si Lili returns to the capital city.

14:15.930 --> 14:18.080
You guess what's going on?

14:20.020 --> 14:21.560
Kill her.

14:21.580 --> 14:23.020
The Investigator's Office has already

14:23.020 --> 14:24.440
set ambushes everywhere.

14:24.460 --> 14:25.220
Fan Xian,

14:25.220 --> 14:27.800
the moment you stepped on the Tianhe Street,

14:27.820 --> 14:29.390
I had already got the report.

14:29.410 --> 14:30.560
So, that you let me in is

14:30.580 --> 14:32.480
to arrest me like catching a turtle in the jar…

14:32.970 --> 14:34.570
Wait, allow me to change a word.

14:34.610 --> 14:36.210
You want to arrest me like beating…

14:40.460 --> 14:41.830
If you want to know the truth,

14:41.850 --> 14:43.650
why don't you interrogate Si Lili by yourself?

14:43.700 --> 14:45.400
You're the chief interrogator.

14:46.530 --> 14:47.650
Me?

14:50.900 --> 14:53.120
It's the key to her cell.

14:53.140 --> 14:55.040
You'll take care of the case of Si Lili.

14:55.900 --> 14:58.030
No matter what decision you will make,

14:58.050 --> 14:59.200
the Investigator's Office

14:59.220 --> 15:01.720
will support you to the end.

15:05.290 --> 15:06.890
Why did you force me to leave at noon?

15:07.460 --> 15:09.160
You hold no official position and is powerless.

15:09.460 --> 15:11.510
The person involved dares to kill commander.

15:11.530 --> 15:13.640
If he knows you are the chief interrogator of Si Lili,

15:13.660 --> 15:15.270
it will do harm to you.

15:15.290 --> 15:17.470
Keeping me out of the affair in public

15:17.490 --> 15:19.330
is actually to protect me.

15:20.020 --> 15:21.950
What if I didn't come tonight?

15:21.970 --> 15:24.480
The Investigator's Office
has nothing to do with you from now on.

15:32.850 --> 15:34.840
Who on earth are you?

15:35.340 --> 15:37.570
Why does the Investigator's Office value you so much?

15:44.260 --> 15:46.250
What you should worry about now

15:47.100 --> 15:49.080
is your own fate.

16:29.930 --> 16:31.480
I don't understand

16:31.820 --> 16:33.720
why you protect him to this extent.

16:34.490 --> 16:36.010
It's what the Head asks me to do.

16:38.170 --> 16:39.240
You have been communicating with the Head

16:39.260 --> 16:41.010
through secret letters.

16:44.780 --> 16:45.610
That's why the black knights

16:45.610 --> 16:47.370
came so timely.

16:48.370 --> 16:50.210
When will the Head return to the capital city?

16:51.370 --> 16:52.440
Soon.

16:52.460 --> 16:53.370
Why does the Head value

16:53.370 --> 16:55.160
Fan Xian so much?

16:56.100 --> 16:58.590
Why not ask him in person?

16:58.610 --> 17:00.040
Yan Ruohai,

17:00.730 --> 17:02.680
have you known some secrets?

17:02.700 --> 17:05.320
I only do what I have been told.

17:07.860 --> 17:08.720
Your Excellency,

17:08.740 --> 17:09.800
a invisible sentry sent messages back,

17:09.820 --> 17:11.890
saying someone is approaching secretly.

17:13.770 --> 17:15.890
There's really someone who wants to kill her.

17:21.130 --> 17:22.530
Have you heard it clearly?

17:23.620 --> 17:24.890
Your fate will

17:25.250 --> 17:27.170
be decided by me.

17:28.500 --> 17:29.510
I get it.

17:29.530 --> 17:30.720
Then tell me the whole story about

17:30.740 --> 17:31.620
the assassination

17:31.620 --> 17:32.700
in the Niulan Street.

17:36.500 --> 17:39.770
I'm from Beiqi and ordered to lurk.

17:40.530 --> 17:43.130
And I have the right to invoke fellows in the capital city.

17:43.290 --> 17:45.390
I'm restricted to nothing

17:45.410 --> 17:47.410
except for the royal orders.

17:51.890 --> 17:53.600
So, you mean it's the Beiqi royal family

17:53.930 --> 17:56.080
that wants to kill me.

17:57.860 --> 18:00.130
Mr. Fan, although you are
endowed with civil and martial virtues,

18:00.220 --> 18:02.890
I'm afraid you don't have the status.

18:03.740 --> 18:04.960
So,

18:05.410 --> 18:06.890
what's the truth?

18:11.050 --> 18:11.860
Someone found that

18:11.860 --> 18:13.440
I am a secret agent.

18:18.130 --> 18:19.840
Have you disclosed some clues?

18:20.170 --> 18:21.680
Not exactly.

18:22.170 --> 18:24.440
Chen Jushu, who lurked outside the capital city

18:24.460 --> 18:25.960
was also caught by him

18:25.980 --> 18:27.440
and sent to the capital city secretly.

18:27.740 --> 18:29.990
But the traces of Cheng Jushu

18:30.010 --> 18:31.530
were only available

18:31.530 --> 18:33.200
to big shots in Beiqi.

18:35.700 --> 18:37.890
Big shots of Beiqi were involved in the case?

18:38.250 --> 18:39.410
Then who else could disclose

18:39.410 --> 18:40.930
my identity?

18:41.650 --> 18:42.960
And then?

18:44.010 --> 18:47.010
Chen Jushu is obstinate and unruly,

18:47.980 --> 18:49.960
so, the guy came to the Joy Tsin House

18:49.980 --> 18:51.870
and forced me to hand out the token of a secret agent.

18:51.890 --> 18:53.250
If I didn't obey what he said,

18:53.410 --> 18:55.440
he would disclose my identity.

18:55.580 --> 18:56.770
Would Cheng Jushu obey the order,

18:56.770 --> 18:58.370
if he saw the token?

18:58.980 --> 19:00.250
Exactly.

19:00.770 --> 19:02.440
I didn't know the one he wanted to kill

19:02.460 --> 19:04.890
was you the other day.

19:06.250 --> 19:08.480
Later I heard the Niulan Street assassination,

19:08.500 --> 19:10.320
I got to know that I wouldn't make it,

19:10.340 --> 19:12.130
so I burned the boat and left the capital city.

19:12.380 --> 19:13.720
And then

19:13.890 --> 19:15.600
I got caught up by you.

19:19.530 --> 19:21.370
There is one point that doesn't make sense.

19:21.890 --> 19:22.620
Now that that guy could

19:22.620 --> 19:24.870
catch Cheng Jushu, the Eighth Dan
Martial Arts Master of Beiqi alive,

19:24.890 --> 19:26.600
why did he make the unnecessary move?

19:26.620 --> 19:28.320
Why not come to kill me in person?

19:29.340 --> 19:30.770
I guess

19:30.930 --> 19:32.990
they don't want to use their followers

19:33.010 --> 19:34.600
to avoid releasing the clues.

19:34.820 --> 19:36.480
When you met that guy,

19:37.220 --> 19:39.010
was there anyone eavesdropping?

19:40.010 --> 19:41.440
How do you know that?

19:42.340 --> 19:43.700
There really was a lady

19:43.700 --> 19:45.680
who made a noise outside the window at that time.

19:46.050 --> 19:46.980
The two disciples of Si Gujian

19:46.980 --> 19:48.290
forced one of her to fall into the Liujing River

19:48.290 --> 19:50.080
with their swords.

19:50.410 --> 19:51.740
I didn't know who the lady was,

19:51.740 --> 19:53.200
because her face was covered with sleeves.

19:53.650 --> 19:56.600
I couldn't see her trace after the salvage, either.

20:01.250 --> 20:03.170
What matters the most is

20:04.930 --> 20:06.890
who wants to kill me.

20:07.170 --> 20:09.770
Let me leave the capital city,

20:09.820 --> 20:12.840
and I'll tell you who he is.

20:18.500 --> 20:20.170
I can't just let you go.

20:20.460 --> 20:22.130
The most I can do is keep you alive.

20:22.890 --> 20:25.480
I'd rather die than years be held in captivity.

20:25.860 --> 20:27.510
Staying alive promises hope, right?

20:27.530 --> 20:29.460
I don't want to stay alive in this way.

20:29.460 --> 20:30.650
You won't tell me?

20:30.930 --> 20:32.200
I won't.

20:33.500 --> 20:34.820
Whatever moves you have,

20:34.820 --> 20:36.680
then use them.

21:06.580 --> 21:08.840
I won't torture you with cruel penalties.

21:09.820 --> 21:11.320
You're soft-hearted?

21:11.340 --> 21:12.720
Besides,

21:14.100 --> 21:14.740
I will tell you

21:14.740 --> 21:17.600
what I'm going to do.

21:17.860 --> 21:19.370
Except putting me to torture,

21:19.620 --> 21:21.440
what else can you do?

21:32.010 --> 21:33.480
To be honest,

21:34.620 --> 21:35.230
I have no idea

21:35.250 --> 21:37.080
how many floors the dungeon has.

21:37.130 --> 21:39.250
You can go ask first.

21:39.860 --> 21:42.410
I will ask someone to dig

21:44.130 --> 21:45.460
a small enough dark room

21:45.460 --> 21:47.650
under the deepest floor

21:48.620 --> 21:50.930
for you to live alone.

21:51.770 --> 21:55.480
It doesn't sound horrible.

21:56.650 --> 21:59.440
What do you think is better to be kept there?

21:59.460 --> 22:01.440
In such a narrow

22:01.460 --> 22:03.650
and retired place,

22:04.410 --> 22:06.560
merely designed for reserving things.

22:09.930 --> 22:11.770
There will be no light

22:13.050 --> 22:14.960
and sound

22:16.010 --> 22:19.680
but the endless darkness and silence.

22:23.620 --> 22:25.080
Trust me,

22:26.620 --> 22:28.560
no one can stay

22:29.620 --> 22:32.680
in such a place like that.

22:38.740 --> 22:40.250
I can choose to die.

22:41.340 --> 22:43.320
At least, I can commit suicide.

22:50.460 --> 22:52.370
Take one,

22:52.740 --> 22:55.600
you will be poisoned to death immediately.

22:59.380 --> 23:00.930
I have offered you the chance to choose.

23:01.700 --> 23:02.910
Either

23:02.930 --> 23:05.530
you spend the rest of your life
in the place under the deep ground,

23:06.130 --> 23:07.560
or

23:09.770 --> 23:11.230
I don't mind you

23:11.250 --> 23:12.890
poisoning yourself to death in front of me.

23:16.650 --> 23:18.290
If I die,

23:19.530 --> 23:20.740
you will never know

23:20.740 --> 23:21.750
who the guy is.

23:21.770 --> 23:23.170
Do as you wish.

23:44.860 --> 23:46.080
Take it.

23:46.100 --> 23:47.800
What are you hesitating for?

23:48.050 --> 23:49.010
Isn't death what you want?

23:49.010 --> 23:50.320
Take it.

23:55.410 --> 23:59.050
Si Lili, you won't poison yourself.

23:59.890 --> 24:01.100
If you want to die,

24:01.100 --> 24:02.580
you'd have killed yourself

24:02.580 --> 24:04.480
when black knights appeared outside the capital city.

24:04.620 --> 24:05.530
When I went downstairs,

24:05.530 --> 24:06.320
I saw you there alone,

24:06.340 --> 24:07.750
locked in the cage

24:07.770 --> 24:09.630
without messy hairs.

24:09.650 --> 24:12.200
You should have tidied yourself up.

24:12.410 --> 24:13.250
How can a person

24:13.250 --> 24:14.960
who cares that much about her appearance

24:15.530 --> 24:17.800
will be willing to die?

24:20.650 --> 24:24.800
Si Lili, you're so young

24:25.290 --> 24:27.600
that you have too many hopes.

24:28.380 --> 24:30.370
You'll get to know one day,

24:33.460 --> 24:35.250
hope

24:35.650 --> 24:36.860
is the most horrible thing

24:36.860 --> 24:38.960
in this world.

24:44.380 --> 24:45.890
Fan Xian,

24:48.580 --> 24:50.220
you're a monster.

24:50.220 --> 24:51.530
You're wrong.

24:52.410 --> 24:53.870
I never eat my words.

24:53.890 --> 24:55.230
You tell me the name,

24:55.250 --> 24:57.320
I will keep you alive.

24:57.500 --> 24:59.320
If I tell you the name,

25:00.460 --> 25:01.800
how would you know whether I'm telling the truth?

25:01.820 --> 25:03.200
I can judge for myself.

25:08.410 --> 25:09.930
Fine.

25:12.580 --> 25:14.410
I tell you the name.

25:16.130 --> 25:18.370
Don't send me to the Ministry of Penalty.

25:19.530 --> 25:21.930
Don't let me suffer these tortures.

25:23.130 --> 25:25.170
Don't let anyone else humiliate me.

25:26.620 --> 25:28.170
I will keep my words.

25:39.220 --> 25:41.410
Aren't you afraid of me lisping my tongue to death?

25:42.770 --> 25:44.170
Do you dare?

25:54.580 --> 25:55.910
It's you, again.

25:55.930 --> 25:57.930
Your Excellency Zhu, Your Excellency Yan.

25:58.220 --> 26:00.080
To tell you the truth,

26:00.100 --> 26:00.840
I return to

26:00.860 --> 26:02.630
take my stuff.

26:02.650 --> 26:03.680
I haven't imagined that

26:03.700 --> 26:04.870
our Investigator's Office is

26:04.890 --> 26:06.560
fortified so heavily.

26:06.580 --> 26:07.720
Good. It's great.

26:07.740 --> 26:09.270
What do you want to take?

26:09.290 --> 26:10.720
Your Excellency,

26:10.890 --> 26:12.390
there are some bank notes

26:12.410 --> 26:13.800
hidden in some of my office-copies

26:13.820 --> 26:15.080
with postils

26:16.930 --> 26:20.170
on the desk of my room.

26:21.170 --> 26:23.250
Hide bank notes in the office-copies?

26:23.500 --> 26:25.150
Your Excellency, you don't know the situation.

26:25.170 --> 26:26.560
My wife always

26:26.580 --> 26:27.820
frisks me

26:27.820 --> 26:29.320
in an extremely thorough way.

26:29.340 --> 26:30.270
So,

26:30.290 --> 26:32.930
I can only choose some other ways to hide my stuffs.

26:33.460 --> 26:34.630
Go search his room.

26:34.650 --> 26:35.960
As you wish.

26:40.290 --> 26:41.720
You see.

26:47.860 --> 26:51.720
Fan Xian, don't investigate it anymore.

27:01.380 --> 27:02.960
Don't tell anyone the truth

27:03.250 --> 27:04.960
I investigate you for.

27:06.290 --> 27:07.840
If someone else questions you,

27:09.100 --> 27:10.890
you can say you're the secret agent of Beiqi.

27:13.050 --> 27:14.320
Don't tell anyone

27:14.340 --> 27:15.770
what the guy forces you into.

27:15.930 --> 27:17.560
But if someone asks me

27:17.580 --> 27:19.480
what you talked with me,

27:19.500 --> 27:20.960
what should I answer?

27:20.980 --> 27:22.840
There must be some other
secret agents in the capital city.

27:22.860 --> 27:24.290
Give him some names.

27:24.820 --> 27:26.560
Choose those who don't get along well with you.

27:26.580 --> 27:27.220
Tell him this is all that

27:27.220 --> 27:28.650
I have found today.

27:28.930 --> 27:30.600
You hide everything

27:30.620 --> 27:32.370
to protect that guy?

27:36.700 --> 27:38.320
I want you to trust me.

27:38.860 --> 27:40.480
I am the only one

27:40.580 --> 27:42.290
who is willing to keep you alive

27:43.130 --> 27:44.650
in the capital city now.

27:50.980 --> 27:52.320
Fine.

28:01.620 --> 28:03.530
The bank note belongs to me.

28:19.700 --> 28:21.170
Thank you, Your Excellency.

28:28.530 --> 28:30.080
Wang Qinian.

28:31.500 --> 28:32.560
How is the interrogation going?

28:32.580 --> 28:33.340
She has admitted that

28:33.340 --> 28:34.560
she is the secret agent from Beiqi.

28:34.580 --> 28:36.410
We have already known it.

28:37.890 --> 28:39.390
This is the list of names of those

28:39.410 --> 28:40.910
Beiqi secret agents who are hiding in the capital city.

28:40.930 --> 28:41.720
Anything else?

28:41.740 --> 28:42.890
That's all.

28:47.220 --> 28:48.930
You really got something.

28:49.500 --> 28:51.110
Leave the rest to me.

28:51.130 --> 28:52.370
Wait.

28:52.410 --> 28:53.720
What's wrong?

28:53.890 --> 28:55.200
I have promised to let her go.

28:55.220 --> 28:56.560
You promised?

28:56.580 --> 28:58.360
No killing, no interrogating.

28:58.380 --> 28:59.560
No torturing.

28:59.580 --> 29:01.200
Just lock her in the dungeon.

29:01.650 --> 29:02.740
Fan Xian, do you think you have

29:02.740 --> 29:04.440
the right to make the decision?

29:04.460 --> 29:06.200
He does have.

29:09.130 --> 29:10.720
It's what the Head asks him to do.

29:10.930 --> 29:12.770
The follow-up to Si Lili's case

29:12.930 --> 29:14.960
will be handed over to Fan Xian.

29:16.980 --> 29:18.740
Interrogate harder and harder.

29:18.740 --> 29:19.580
Interrogate harder.

29:19.580 --> 29:20.910
We must be able to find out something.

29:20.930 --> 29:22.720
It's the Head's decision.

29:26.220 --> 29:27.840
My plan is really simple.

29:27.890 --> 29:29.270
Lock her inside.

29:29.290 --> 29:30.630
Don't let anyone bother her.

29:30.650 --> 29:31.440
One more thing,

29:31.460 --> 29:32.840
don't let anyone know

29:32.860 --> 29:34.480
that I have already interrogated her.

29:34.500 --> 29:36.080
Do as you wish.

29:41.620 --> 29:45.010
Your Excellency, what do you think?

29:47.010 --> 29:49.010
It's the Head's decision.

29:56.980 --> 29:58.320
Can I take him away?

29:58.340 --> 29:59.600
It's up to you.

30:02.530 --> 30:04.410
Let's go, Wang.

30:20.770 --> 30:22.560
You said you wouldn't come with me, didn't you?

30:24.010 --> 30:25.530
I couldn't help

30:25.580 --> 30:27.410
but come here to check it out.

30:32.220 --> 30:35.130
Wang Qinian, you're a good man.

30:38.290 --> 30:39.770
What are you laughing at?

30:40.050 --> 30:41.390
I never thought I would be the one

30:41.410 --> 30:42.220
to send you

30:42.220 --> 30:43.840
the Good Man Card.

30:44.380 --> 30:47.170
What is the Good Man Card?

30:47.580 --> 30:48.750
Nothing.

30:48.770 --> 30:50.800
Nothing will happen tonight. You can go home.

30:51.620 --> 30:54.440
Your Excellency, have you found out any clues?

31:05.050 --> 31:06.440
You guys.

31:06.700 --> 31:08.440
Listen to me.

31:08.500 --> 31:10.150
Keep what I say in mind.

31:10.170 --> 31:11.770
Later when you go outside in the street,

31:11.980 --> 31:13.150
use all your strength to

31:13.170 --> 31:14.440
ring drums and gongs.

31:14.460 --> 31:15.800
Use all your strength.

31:15.930 --> 31:17.290
You who beat drums

31:17.380 --> 31:18.750
don't stop

31:18.770 --> 31:19.960
until you break your drums.

31:19.980 --> 31:21.080
And you who beat small cymbals

31:21.100 --> 31:22.870
should make it louder than big cymbals.

31:22.890 --> 31:25.080
And you who beat big cymbals
should make it louder than gongs.

31:25.100 --> 31:25.990
Are you clear?

31:26.010 --> 31:27.290
Fan Sizhe.

31:27.620 --> 31:29.200
You're running wild again.

31:29.500 --> 31:30.890
Sister, I'm not.

31:31.010 --> 31:32.840
I'm intending to help Fan Xian.

31:32.860 --> 31:33.720
Fan Xian says

31:33.740 --> 31:35.320
he's going to meet my future sister-in-law.

31:35.340 --> 31:36.010
He asks me to

31:36.010 --> 31:37.560
make a greater show of power.

31:37.580 --> 31:38.910
This is magnificent.

31:38.930 --> 31:40.370
Turn around, you guys.

31:40.860 --> 31:42.050
Brother.

31:43.050 --> 31:44.960
I went to Wan'er's place yesterday

31:45.050 --> 31:47.320
and was stopped by her second brother.

31:47.860 --> 31:49.440
I guess it must be because of me sneaking

31:49.460 --> 31:51.480
into Wan'er's room.

31:51.650 --> 31:54.130
I pondered over it for the whole night

31:54.220 --> 31:55.560
and finally figured it out.

31:55.580 --> 31:58.130
I'd better go there in public

31:58.530 --> 32:01.320
in this way and at an open and frank attitude.

32:01.340 --> 32:02.630
I will please him

32:02.650 --> 32:05.650
and transfer his anger to happiness.

32:05.980 --> 32:07.960
Isn't it magnificent enough?

32:07.980 --> 32:10.250
A wedding ceremony won't be better than this.

32:13.820 --> 32:15.890
Not to mention him sneaking in,

32:16.340 --> 32:17.620
now he goes so far as to

32:17.620 --> 32:20.050
come here with ringing gangs and drums.

32:21.250 --> 32:23.010
If I don't split him to death,

32:23.100 --> 32:25.250
I will give up my fame.

32:25.380 --> 32:26.500
The ones using long weapons guard outside.

32:26.500 --> 32:27.990
Those who are good at hidden weapons burn his bridge.

32:28.010 --> 32:28.740
Don't be flustered.

32:28.740 --> 32:30.270
Kill him as soon as he steps into the courtyard.

32:30.290 --> 32:31.270
I will face the music

32:31.290 --> 32:32.990
after he dies.

32:33.010 --> 32:34.560
Let him in

32:34.580 --> 32:36.480
but give him little chance of going back.

32:38.340 --> 32:39.200
Dismiss.

32:39.220 --> 32:40.650
As you wish.

32:57.700 --> 32:59.600
Fan Xian, from the Fans mansion,

32:59.820 --> 33:02.150
goes specially to the imperial residence

33:02.170 --> 33:03.720
to visit the Princess.

33:03.740 --> 33:06.110
This a great story on everybody's lips.

33:06.130 --> 33:09.030
Hope everyone can join us to celebrate for him.

33:09.050 --> 33:11.630
Bravo.

33:11.650 --> 33:13.960
Bravo.

33:13.980 --> 33:16.130
Fan Sizhe is really gregarious.

33:17.250 --> 33:18.360
Brother,

33:18.380 --> 33:19.150
Mr. Lin is the second brother

33:19.170 --> 33:20.720
of the sister-in-law after all.

33:20.740 --> 33:21.960
I know it.

33:22.380 --> 33:24.110
You went to her boudoir secretly.

33:24.130 --> 33:26.320
It's natural that he got angry.

33:27.890 --> 33:30.250
So I go there in public this time.

33:31.500 --> 33:33.680
It's no better than sneaking.

33:33.890 --> 33:34.960
Is it?

33:34.980 --> 33:35.580
If you do it like this,

33:35.580 --> 33:36.860
it seems like you show disrespect

33:36.860 --> 33:38.480
to Mr. Lin.

33:38.740 --> 33:40.290
Do you think so?

33:43.820 --> 33:45.960
You didn't do this on purpose, did you?

33:47.820 --> 33:49.130
On purpose for what?

33:49.460 --> 33:50.870
You go there in public deliberately to

33:50.890 --> 33:52.410
deceive the public

33:52.460 --> 33:54.320
and relax their vigilance

33:54.340 --> 33:56.370
by the farce with Mr. Lin.

33:56.700 --> 33:58.410
Why would I do this?

33:59.250 --> 34:00.650
Could it be that you've found clues

34:00.650 --> 34:02.170
to the case happened in the Niulan Street?

34:03.700 --> 34:04.480
Brilliant.

34:04.500 --> 34:05.720
Is that so?

34:05.740 --> 34:07.600
It's not proper to talk about this now
I will tell you the details later.

34:07.620 --> 34:08.470
Ruoruo,

34:08.490 --> 34:10.600
you can't go any further.

34:10.620 --> 34:11.800
Or…

34:13.050 --> 34:14.160
I'll wait here for you.

34:14.180 --> 34:15.320
Okay.

34:20.900 --> 34:22.210
Second brother,

34:23.380 --> 34:26.080
Second brother, why do you have to create tension?

34:26.100 --> 34:29.520
This bastard Fan Xian, his motive is execrable.

34:30.690 --> 34:32.380
Why does he come here

34:32.380 --> 34:33.420
aggressively?

34:33.420 --> 34:35.370
Because I don't let him see you.

34:35.420 --> 34:37.710
Your identity can't be known by the public.

34:37.730 --> 34:38.940
Now he makes

34:38.940 --> 34:39.730
everyone know it deliberately.

34:39.730 --> 34:41.050
He wants to force me to retreat

34:41.050 --> 34:42.340
without interfering

34:42.340 --> 34:43.050
in the name of the Prime Minister.

34:43.050 --> 34:44.210
Fine.

34:45.210 --> 34:47.240
I won't show up to stop him.

34:47.820 --> 34:49.490
I'll let him in.

34:49.690 --> 34:51.650
Once he comes in,

34:51.690 --> 34:53.800
he won't have the chance to go back.

34:54.100 --> 34:56.890
Second brother, why do you have to do this?

35:04.100 --> 35:05.650
Second brother.

35:12.340 --> 35:14.490
Her Highness is as gorgeous as a goddess.

35:14.940 --> 35:17.320
I, Fan Xian, have been adoring her for long.

35:17.340 --> 35:18.840
Since we have the marriage contract,

35:18.860 --> 35:20.800
I should have the chance to meet her.

35:20.820 --> 35:21.800
Am I right?

35:21.820 --> 35:24.270
Let him in. Let him in. Let him in.

35:24.290 --> 35:26.730
Let him in.

35:26.730 --> 35:29.320
Let him in. Let him in. Let him in.

35:29.340 --> 35:31.490
Let him in. They should meet each other.

35:32.820 --> 35:34.140
Thank you for coming here.

35:34.140 --> 35:35.360
Thanks.

35:35.380 --> 35:36.710
Thank you.

35:36.730 --> 35:37.290
Let him in.

35:37.290 --> 35:39.270
Let him in. Let him in.

35:39.290 --> 35:40.470
Let him in.

35:40.490 --> 35:41.640
Let him in.

35:41.660 --> 35:43.890
We make it.

36:08.420 --> 36:09.360
You should leave!

36:09.380 --> 36:10.890
The Second Young Master is going to kill you.

36:38.420 --> 36:39.430
To think it over,

36:39.450 --> 36:41.230
it's ridiculous to come here today in this way.

36:41.250 --> 36:43.130
I'll see you again.

36:44.900 --> 36:46.890
They're indeed masters of seventh Dan

37:03.210 --> 37:03.880
Second Young Master.

37:03.900 --> 37:04.800
What's up?

37:04.820 --> 37:05.880
As you have ordered,

37:05.900 --> 37:07.120
we surrounded Fan Xian

37:07.140 --> 37:08.840
as soon as he stepped into the courtyard.

37:08.860 --> 37:09.560
We didn't imagine that

37:09.580 --> 37:11.250
he is so crafty.

37:11.250 --> 37:12.380
He climbed over the wall and ran away

37:12.380 --> 37:13.730
after exchanging several blows with us.

37:13.730 --> 37:15.560
We didn't chase him anymore.

37:15.580 --> 37:16.950
Trash!

37:16.970 --> 37:18.130
Back off!

37:18.210 --> 37:19.600
As you wish.

37:22.380 --> 37:23.490
Brat!

37:23.490 --> 37:25.650
Is he a psycho?

37:25.730 --> 37:27.250
He came here with great fanfare

37:27.250 --> 37:28.800
but left without hesitation.

37:28.820 --> 37:30.600
What on earth does he want?

37:31.620 --> 37:32.750
He is not supposed to

37:32.770 --> 37:34.100
go against you.

37:34.100 --> 37:36.490
He has gone too far!

37:38.010 --> 37:39.160
Second brother,

37:39.180 --> 37:40.100
It's His Majesty

37:40.100 --> 37:41.100
who ordered us to get engaged.

37:41.100 --> 37:41.770
But you're a daughter

37:41.770 --> 37:42.900
of the Prime Minister.

37:42.900 --> 37:44.490
We don't have connections in public.

37:44.490 --> 37:45.920
Wan'er.

37:45.940 --> 37:47.840
You know the identity of our father.

37:48.140 --> 37:49.950
He can't accept you in public.

37:49.970 --> 37:52.320
And he has a guilty conscience.

37:54.730 --> 37:55.600
I know it.

37:55.620 --> 37:56.920
Though he doesn't speak it out loud,

37:56.940 --> 37:58.560
you're still the daughter of the Lin family.

37:58.580 --> 38:00.560
A man like Fan Xian doesn't

38:00.580 --> 38:01.600
deserve you.

38:01.620 --> 38:02.800
Second brother,

38:02.820 --> 38:04.580
you have just met him for several times,

38:04.580 --> 38:06.520
why do you make such a judgement?

38:08.620 --> 38:10.760
This is what our father wants.

38:12.050 --> 38:13.450
He has already prepared the office-copy well

38:13.450 --> 38:15.050
and will choose a right time
to report to His Majesty in person

38:15.050 --> 38:17.040
and ask him to call off the marriage contract.

38:17.340 --> 38:19.190
Whatever messes Fan Xian makes,

38:19.210 --> 38:21.130
he won't be able to change the overall situation.

38:22.970 --> 38:24.600
He won't get a chance to marry you.

38:51.010 --> 38:52.840
I've just heard that you went to find Wan'er.

38:52.860 --> 38:54.160
Why are you here?

38:54.180 --> 38:55.800
The same question I asked you last time.

38:55.820 --> 38:56.990
Who was the guy

38:57.010 --> 38:57.690
staying with Si Lili

38:57.690 --> 38:59.030
in the Joy Tsin House the other day?

38:59.050 --> 39:00.600
No matter how many times you ask me,
I won't say anything.

39:00.660 --> 39:02.320
He is Lin Gong.

39:08.100 --> 39:10.690
He is the second son of the Lin family.

39:11.180 --> 39:12.560
Lin Gong.

39:15.620 --> 39:16.140
I have known the answer

39:16.140 --> 39:17.560
through your eyes.

39:17.970 --> 39:19.210
It's him.

39:54.970 --> 39:56.490
How could it be him?

40:03.620 --> 40:05.210
How do you know that?

40:05.340 --> 40:06.010
I didn't believe it

40:06.010 --> 40:06.950
when I first heard

40:06.970 --> 40:07.920
the name.

40:07.940 --> 40:09.670
Since I don't have a feud with him,

40:09.690 --> 40:10.900
so I roughly investigated

40:10.900 --> 40:12.320
his background.

40:12.340 --> 40:14.410
I drew a simple conclusion that

40:14.620 --> 40:16.050
the Second Young Master of the Prime Minister Mansion

40:16.050 --> 40:17.180
is one of the flat-out followers

40:17.180 --> 40:18.760
of the Crown Prince.

40:20.490 --> 40:21.750
And

40:21.770 --> 40:22.380
this is the reason why

40:22.380 --> 40:24.490
you don't dare to tell me the truth.

40:25.970 --> 40:28.600
The Ye family has the support of the Great Master,

40:28.820 --> 40:30.140
so the son of Prime Minister doesn't

40:30.140 --> 40:31.410
mean anything to you.

40:31.730 --> 40:33.320
But when it comes to the Crown Prince,
the situation is different.

40:33.420 --> 40:35.120
If you offend the Crown Prince,

40:35.140 --> 40:36.770
the status of the Ye family in the Nanqing

40:36.770 --> 40:38.840
will be at risk.

40:39.620 --> 40:41.490
You know that

40:41.860 --> 40:43.990
the Crown Prince is the future emperor of the Nanqing.

40:44.010 --> 40:45.270
No matter who asks me about this question,

40:45.290 --> 40:46.750
I won't admit that

40:46.770 --> 40:48.650
the one I met the other day was Lin Gong.

40:51.050 --> 40:52.360
I understand.

40:52.380 --> 40:54.410
What I want is the truth.

40:55.010 --> 40:56.890
I won't make you testify for me.

40:58.820 --> 41:00.170
Fan Xian.

41:00.860 --> 41:02.130
Just forget it.

41:02.290 --> 41:05.490
You shouldn't go any further.

41:07.140 --> 41:08.340
If no one died,

41:08.340 --> 41:09.750
I would be willing to let it go.

41:09.770 --> 41:11.340
Cheng Jushu was killed by you.

41:11.340 --> 41:12.450
He is not the real murderer.

41:12.450 --> 41:14.650
But the man died is just a guard.

41:19.290 --> 41:21.130
Everyone says the same thing.

41:22.530 --> 41:23.420
It really

41:23.420 --> 41:24.650
makes me furious the most.

41:26.940 --> 41:28.560
Have I said anything wrong?

41:29.180 --> 41:31.600
Does the guard have another identity?

41:31.860 --> 41:35.370
No, he doesn't. He is just a guard.

41:37.290 --> 41:39.800
People in the whole world take him as nobody.

41:40.690 --> 41:42.320
I don't agree with them.

41:42.940 --> 41:44.970
What else can you do?

41:49.380 --> 41:51.240
Thanks for telling me the truth.

41:59.420 --> 42:02.080
Wan'er, take care of yourself

42:02.100 --> 42:04.490
and don't be bothered by these things.

42:04.940 --> 42:07.170
Since His Majesty ordered Fan Xian to leave Danzhou,

42:08.690 --> 42:10.050
he must have made up his mind.

42:10.050 --> 42:11.950
Father and I will take care of these.

42:11.970 --> 42:13.180
His Majesty won't allow us to

42:13.180 --> 42:14.840
call off the marriage contract,

42:15.010 --> 42:16.530
even though father submits the memorials.

42:16.530 --> 42:17.360
The result won't change.

42:17.380 --> 42:19.160
There is always a way.

42:19.180 --> 42:20.430
Don't worry.

42:20.450 --> 42:23.080
I won't put you at risk.

42:26.490 --> 42:28.370
But I'm willing to marry him.

42:30.050 --> 42:31.380
You're deceived by

42:31.380 --> 42:33.240
the sweet words of that brat.

42:33.820 --> 42:35.400
He really has a glib tongue

42:35.420 --> 42:37.670
and doesn't behave seriously sometimes,

42:37.690 --> 42:39.920
but the expression in his eyes is really pure.

42:39.940 --> 42:40.950
Second brother,

42:40.970 --> 42:42.100
I don't know what has happened

42:42.100 --> 42:43.750
between you two,

42:43.770 --> 42:45.360
but he is definitely not a flibbertigibbet.

42:45.380 --> 42:46.050
What kind of man he is

42:46.050 --> 42:47.490
doesn't matter now.

42:47.820 --> 42:49.030
Maybe he is a good man,

42:49.050 --> 42:49.820
or maybe as you say,

42:49.820 --> 42:50.470
he is sincere.

42:50.490 --> 42:51.430
But he isn't supposed to come to the capital city.

42:51.450 --> 42:52.970
Many people have been staring at him.

42:54.530 --> 42:55.930
What do you mean?

43:19.920 --> 43:23.500
In the river of history,

43:23.520 --> 43:26.990
time goes round and round.

43:29.800 --> 43:33.140
Memories about the former and present lives

43:33.160 --> 43:37.230
join each other in an endless way.

43:39.120 --> 43:41.740
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:41.760 --> 43:44.000
one season follows another in a flash,

43:44.000 --> 43:46.500
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:46.520 --> 43:48.120
I just can't give up

43:48.120 --> 43:51.460
to be with you for my whole life.

43:51.480 --> 43:56.950
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:58.200 --> 44:00.750
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

44:01.040 --> 44:03.080
Year after year in the wandering,

44:03.080 --> 44:05.740
I count the remaining years.

44:05.760 --> 44:07.940
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:07.960 --> 44:09.950
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:10.240 --> 44:12.630
I never feel regretful.

44:12.680 --> 44:14.040
In such a chaotic world,

44:14.040 --> 44:17.020
I still miss you as ever.

44:17.040 --> 44:19.990
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:20.280 --> 44:22.340
With a gentle heart,

44:22.360 --> 44:25.020
I cherish our remaining years.

44:25.040 --> 44:26.560
Even though we have to go through

44:26.560 --> 44:29.070
all the hardships along the journey,

44:29.200 --> 44:36.390
you always stay by my side,

44:36.480 --> 44:39.150
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:39.440 --> 44:41.520
Year after year in the wandering,

44:41.520 --> 44:44.180
I count the remaining years.

44:44.200 --> 44:46.340
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:46.360 --> 44:48.590
even though we end up the destiny,

44:48.800 --> 44:50.980
I never feel regretful.

44:51.000 --> 44:52.400
In such a chaotic world,

44:52.400 --> 44:55.460
I still miss you as ever.

44:55.480 --> 44:58.590
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:58.680 --> 45:00.820
With a gentle heart,

45:00.840 --> 45:03.540
I cherish our remaining years.

45:03.560 --> 45:05.000
Even though we have to go through

45:05.000 --> 45:07.660
all the hardships along the journey,

45:07.680 --> 45:16.440
you always stay by my side...
